# Task Manager API

A small Flask REST API that implements CRUD for tasks.

## Features
- Create, read, update, delete tasks (JSON)
- Simple in-memory storage (sample_data.json)

## Run
1. Clone repo
2. Install: `pip install -r requirements.txt`
3. Run: `python app.py`

Test endpoints with Postman or curl: GET /tasks, POST /tasks, PUT /tasks/:id, DELETE /tasks/:id
